    '<span id="ref-22"></span>Amato L, Davoli M, Minozzi S, Ferroni E, Ali R, Ferri M. 2013, Cochrane Database Syst Rev (2):CD003409. doi:10.1002/14651858.CD003409.pub4. PMID 23450540. PMC7017622. <a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7017622/" rel="noopener">pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7017622/</a>',
