    'US Food and Drug Administration. "Information about Medications for Opioid Use Disorder (MOUD)". Content current as of 12/26/2024. <a href="https://www.fda.gov/drugs/food-and-drug-administration-overdose-prevention-framework/information-about-medications-opioid-use-disorder-moud" rel="noopener">fda.gov/drugs/food-and-drug-administration-overdose-prevention-framework/information-about-medications-opioid-use-disorder-moud</a>',
    'Knuijver T, Schellekens A, Belgers M, et al. 2022, Addiction 117(1). doi:10.1111/add.15448. PMC9292417. <a href="https://europepmc.org/article/PMC/PMC9292417" rel="noopener">europepmc.org/article/PMC/PMC9292417</a>',
