    'Maillet EL, Milon N, Heghinian MD, Fishback J, Schurer SC, Garamszegi N, Mash DC. 2015, Neuropharmacology 99:675-688. doi:10.1016/j.neuropharm.2015.08.032. PMID 26302653. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.neuropharm.2015.08.032" rel="noopener">doi.org/10.1016/j.neuropharm.2015.08.032</a>',
