    'Shen MR, Owusu-Boaitey K, Murphy ZD, et al. 2026, Front Psychiatry 17:1909149. doi:10.3389/fpsyt.2026.1909149. PMID 42755825. PMC13581858. <a href="https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/psychiatry/articles/10.3389/fpsyt.2026.1909149/full" rel="noopener">frontiersin.org/journals/psychiatry/articles/10.3389/fpsyt.2026.1909149/full</a>',
    'Kervadec E, Bezo A, Serreau R, et al. 2026, J Clin Psychopharmacol. doi:10.1097/jcp.0000000000002197. PMID 42228481. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1097/jcp.0000000000002197" rel="noopener">doi.org/10.1097/jcp.0000000000002197</a>',
